==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relay Base (Enemy Base)|Relay Base]].
*3 [[White Wind]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[White Wind]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat/Pizza Cat]] for the Gory Darks and Le'noir; [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and/or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for the Bores. If you have any anti-Traitless Cats, bring them here as they are required for the R.Osts. Otherwise, bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] + 3 meatshields in order to chip down R.Ost as quickly as possible, since dealing with two R.Osts will be majorly troublesome.

